---
title: "C21 — Retry and duplicate safety · Implemented"
---
flowchart TD
  Failure{Failure window} -->|Before activity insert| Retry[Retry stored event]
  Failure -->|After activity insert| Existing[Insert activity or verify existing event-linked row]
  Failure -->|After publish, before completion| Duplicate[Publication may repeat]
  Failure -->|Queue data lost| Recheck[Undelivered DB row becomes due]
  Recheck --> Retry
  Existing --> Publish[Publish invalidation]
  Retry --> Existing
  Duplicate --> Dedupe[API and client dedupe; REST remains truth]
  Publish --> Done[Mark delivered after successful publish]
  Offline[Browser disconnected] --> Resync[Reconnect and refetch]
  NoReplay[PubSub has no durable replay] -. reason .-> Resync
